00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:09.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're gonna take turns
drawing one of these cards.

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:13.046
Each card has five totally
random questions on it, okay?

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:15.949
One person asks the questions,
The other person has to answer

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:18.218 align:start size:94% position:6%
