00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:20.720
It doesn't matter if the answer
is right or wrong.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.391
It just has to be the very first
thing that pops in your head.

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:25.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
